[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2596161013","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101628#issuecomment-2596161013","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101628","id":2596161013,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6avkX1","user":{"login":"bs-mwoerner","id":35597337,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTk3MzM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35597337?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner","html_url":"https://github.com/bs-mwoerner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-16T16:22:04Z","updated_at":"2025-01-16T16:22:04Z","body":"Hm, the [documentation on constants](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.html#constants) says *\"Constants are values you cannot change when the game is running. Their value must be known at compile-time.\"*, so I suppose whether you consider this a bug in the engine or a bug in the project depends on whether you consider the resource's property to be part if its \"value\". Not sure if the docs contain an explicit statement on that somewhere, but there's this example:\n```gdscript\nconst D = Vector2(20, 30).x # Constant expression: 20.\n```\nThis could be read as \"a property of a constant object is constant\" and indeed, doing\n```gdscript\nconst v = Vector2(20, 30)\nconst x = v.x # Still a constant expression\n```\nis fine, but\n```gdscript\nvar v = Vector2(20, 30)\nconst x = v.x # Not a constant expression\n```\ngives *\"Assigned value for constant \"x\" isn't a constant expression.\"*\n\nIf we extend that logic to your example,\n```gdscript\nconst my_resource_const:TestResource = preload(\"res://my_test_resource.tres\")\n[...]\nprint(\"Const: \", my_resource_const.value, \" Var: \", my_resource_var.value)\n```\nthen `my_resource_const.value` must be known at compile time, which is possible because it's the property of a resource acquired via `preload`. As a consquence, however, the printed value should never change across different calls to `_process()`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2596161013/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2596273693","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101628#issuecomment-2596273693","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101628","id":2596273693,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6av_4d","user":{"login":"derkork","id":327257,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzI1Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/327257?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/derkork","html_url":"https://github.com/derkork","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derkork/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derkork/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derkork/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derkork/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derkork/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derkork/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derkork/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derkork/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/derkork/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-16T17:11:16Z","updated_at":"2025-01-16T17:11:16Z","body":"The example is not comparing the same things. When going with the example it would need to be the `value` property that is assigned to a constant:\n\n```gdscript\nconst my_resource_const_value:Vector3 = preload(\"res://my_test_resource.tres\").value\n```\n\nThe compiler doesn't like this and  says that _'Assigned value for constant \"my_resource_const_value\" isn't a constant expression.'_ . And it can't be guaranteed as constant, as other code can change its value. Using `preload` doesn't guarantee that internal values of a resource never change.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2596273693/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2596402544","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101628#issuecomment-2596402544","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101628","id":2596402544,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6awfVw","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-16T18:18:22Z","updated_at":"2025-01-16T18:18:22Z","body":"> const my_resource_const_value:Vector3 = preload(\"res://my_test_resource.tres\").value\n> \n> The compiler doesn't like this and  says that _'Assigned value for constant \"my_resource_const_value\" isn't a constant expression.'_\n\nNo, surprisingly GDScript allows it, I even created a [repository](https://github.com/dalexeev/gdscript-compile-time-evaluations) about this fact. But I'm not sure if this is correct behavior, we have some problems with \"constant objects\" (scripts and resources).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2596402544/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2596458077","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101628#issuecomment-2596458077","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101628","id":2596458077,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aws5d","user":{"login":"bs-mwoerner","id":35597337,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTk3MzM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35597337?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner","html_url":"https://github.com/bs-mwoerner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-16T18:41:40Z","updated_at":"2025-01-16T18:41:40Z","body":"Actually, in the concrete example of the MRP, this\n```gdscript\nconst my_resource_const_value:Vector3 = preload(\"res://my_test_resource.tres\").value\n```\nindeed doesn't work, but I think the error message is a bit misleading here. `value` is not marked as `@export`, so I assume it doesn't exist as far as `preload` is concerned. You get the same \"not a constant expression\" error when accessing any other, non-existing property name.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2596458077/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2705405293","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101628#issuecomment-2705405293","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101628","id":2705405293,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hQTVt","user":{"login":"EviTRea","id":32661913,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNjYxOTEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32661913?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EviTRea","html_url":"https://github.com/EviTRea","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EviTRea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EviTRea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EviTRea/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EviTRea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EviTRea/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EviTRea/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EviTRea/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EviTRea/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EviTRea/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T02:57:09Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T02:57:09Z","body":"4.4 here. Spent like 2 hours yesterday figuring out why I can call set_value and correctly update the target resource, but it always return the default value somehow.\nI thought this was some engine caveat, but if it's not a behaviour presents before 4.3, it's definitely a problem; if it's somehow intentional, it should've been in the doc at least. \n`const MY_RESOURCE: MyResource = preload(\"uid://something\")` is not some ultra niche use case in my opinion, pointing to the actual resource only some of the time is troublesome.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2705405293/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3288894359","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101628#issuecomment-3288894359","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101628","id":3288894359,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ECIuX","user":{"login":"bsil78","id":13476087,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDc2MDg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13476087?v=4","gravatar_id":"",